# Providers and tools: the inline /providers panel and the /tools catalog (browsing only; nothing is installed).
Output assets/readme/tools.gif

Hide
Type "cd ~/Projects/demo && clear && nmsh"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

Type "/providers"
Sleep 0.5s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 0.8s
Escape
Sleep 0.8s
Type "/tools"
Sleep 0.5s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Down@3
Space
Sleep 1s
Down@3
Space
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 0.8s
Type "git"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 0.5s
Escape
Sleep 1s
